## Summary

Two features shipped this session:

1. **Mirrorlist regeneration safety** — removed regenerate from pacnew center,
   added automatic backup/restore, confirmation dialog.

2. **Dependency tree visualization** — color-coded recursive tree in AUR install
   preview modal (Task 3 of AUR security plan).

3. **Audit rule-health dashboard** — new System Health card that can run a
   background rescan of live AUR PKGBUILDs and surface noisy/stale rules.
   Uses existing audit_rescan.py module. Scan runs on the shared executor
   thread pool; results are cached per session.

**Verification:** 757 tests passed, JS contracts green.

